are/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Given the schema:\r\n```sql\r\nCREATE TABLE elements (id int PRIMARY KEY, val int, grp int);\r\nCREATE INDEX elements_idx ON elements (grp) INCLUDE (val);\r\n```\r\n`EXPLAIN` shows that only the first of the following cases involves index:\r\n```\r\npostgres=# EXPLAIN SELECT val FROM elements WHERE grp = 3;\r\n                                    QUERY PLAN\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Index Only Scan using elements_idx on elements  (cost=0.00..4.11 rows=1 width=4)\r\n   Index Cond: (grp = 3)\r\n```\r\n```\r\npostgres=# EXPLAIN SELECT val FROM elements WHERE grp IN (1,2,3);\r\n                           QUERY PLAN\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Foreign Scan on elements  (cost=0.00..103.75 rows=1000 width=4)\r\n   Filter: (grp = ANY ('{1,2,3}'::integer[]))\r\n```\r\n```\r\npostgres=# EXPLAIN SELECT val FROM elements WHERE grp > 1 AND grp < 2;\r\n                           QUERY PLAN\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Foreign Scan on elements  (cost=0.00..105.00 rows=1000 width=4)\r\n   Filter: ((grp > 1) AND (grp < 2))\r\n```\r\n(`BETWEEN`, etc. are also worth checking)\r\n\r\nFor reference, in Postgres they all have plans like this:\r\n```\r\nfs=# EXPLAIN SELECT val FROM elements WHERE grp IN (1,2,3);\r\n                                 QUERY PLAN\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n Bitmap Heap Scan on elements  (cost=4.69..15.12 rows=31 width=4)\r\n   Recheck Cond: (grp = ANY ('{1,2,3}'::integer[]))\r\n   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on elements_idx  (cost=0.00..4.68 rows=31 width=0)\r\n         Index Cond: (grp = ANY ('{1,2,3}'::integer[]))\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1554/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/502779470","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/995#issuecomment-502779470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/995","id":502779470,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUwMjc3OTQ3MA==","user":{"login":"ndeodhar","id":15746068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzQ2MDY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15746068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar","html_url":"https://github.com/ndeodhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndeodhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-06-17T17:34:26Z","updated_at":"2019-06-17T17:34:26Z","body":"Reopening this because IN clause still does not use the secondary index but does a scan on the base table instead. See https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/issues/1554 for an example.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/502779470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"eve